OL,3,GNEWSAStolen orangutan statue found     
OL,4,Aafter two months                       
OL,6,FA giant orangutan statue has been found
OL,7,Fmore than two months after a thief     
OL,8,Fstole it from a garden centre.         
OL,10,FThe statue, valued at just under #800, 
OL,11,Fdisappeared from Scotsdales Garden     
OL,12,FCentre in Horningsea, Cambridgeshire,  
OL,13,Fon 7 September.                        
OL,15,FDerek Lundgren, 61, of New Road,       
OL,16,FSawston, was jailed earlier this month 
OL,17,Fafter admitting the theft.             
