OL,3,GNEWSAStolen orangutan statue found     
OL,4,Aafter two months                       
OL,6,FCambridgeshire Police said it received 
OL,7,Fa tip-off on the orangutan's           
OL,8,Fwhereabouts from a member of the public
OL,9,Fwho had seen media coverage of         
OL,10,FLundgren's sentencing.                 
